Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.31,0:00:01.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Kikkun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.20,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnFredoka\b1\fs17\1c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H000000&\bord1.5\pos(110.4,54.4)}The Mystery of the Pyramid, datsun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.11,0:00:04.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much for taking the trouble \Nto come out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.91,0:00:07.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been a while since I've been to the pyramid.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.55,0:00:08.99,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what is it? \NAnother special program?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.47,0:00:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. It seems the TV station is planning another special \Nto unravel the mysteries of the pyramid.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.29,0:00:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I've gathered you all here to figure out countermeasures.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.69,0:00:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,As aliens, we'd be in trouble if the mysteries \Nof the pyramid were unraveled.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.37,0:00:24.72,Default,,0,0,0,,So what are we gonna do this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.01,0:00:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Are we gonna have Uncle Squid disguise himself \Nas an archaeologist and talk nonsense again, tsun?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.97,0:00:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh, again?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.05,0:00:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What did he say last time, by the way?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.71,0:00:40.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Something like "It wasn't a king's tomb, \Nbut a temple to hear the words of God."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.83,0:00:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That theory lasted for two whole years, tsun.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.35,0:00:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.31,0:00:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Then how about this? \N"Actually, it was Oda Nobunaga's tomb all along!"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.43,0:00:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa! If we pull that card, urban legends have truly hit rock bottom.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.62,0:00:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Though the Japanese would probably believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.22,0:00:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Like, there was a single king barely known to the locals...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.27,0:01:03.23,Default,,0,0,0,,And that king was actually Nobunaga who crossed over \Nto Egypt after surviving or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.50,0:01:05.67,Default,,0,0,0,,The Japanese would totally love that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.02,0:01:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,And that king would kill any cuckoo bird that wouldn't sing right away or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.31,0:01:12.63,Default,,0,0,0,,His catchphrase was "Life is 50 years" or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.67,0:01:14.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Or maybe he had a long face or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.27,0:01:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,That's definitely Nobunaga!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.59,0:01:23.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then, Mr. Squid, \Nwe're counting on you for the Nobunaga angle.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.35,0:01:25.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have much confidence, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.24,0:01:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We just need to make sure nobody \Nfinds out the pyramid is a UFO launchpad.
